[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9725.67, "timestamp": "02:42:05", "text": "好的。没有噪音。该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9728.469, "timestamp": "02:42:08", "text": "习惯这一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9730.63, "timestamp": "02:42:10", "text": "伏击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9735.349, "timestamp": "02:42:15", "text": "嗯哼。它如何运作？它能持续多久？呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.19, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "我不知道，我只是猜测声音什么时候会响起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9741.03, "timestamp": "02:42:21", "text": "停止。当它停止发出声音时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9746.95, "timestamp": "02:42:26", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9750.63, "timestamp": "02:42:30", "text": "好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9753.67, "timestamp": "02:42:33", "text": "我的天哪。我们无法复活。我们重新开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9764.349, "timestamp": "02:42:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9767.19, "timestamp": "02:42:47", "text": "是的。罗布乐思。那种氛围改变了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9778.55, "timestamp": "02:42:58", "text": "呃，我得拍张照。实际上，是一道闪光。"}]